# Rebuild on request only

Do **not** run `npm run build:win` after routine code changes. Full packaging is expensive and unstable in long agent sessions here.

Rebuild only when the user asks for a build, package, or portable exe.

When rebuilding: stop `Image Generator` if running, then `npm run build:win` from `desktopApp`. Node from Herd if needed: `C:\Users\CDD_Tech\.config\herd\bin\nvm\v22.23.1`.
